  "scope": "Complete unchanged Decoders530.kt, Packet.kt, IoBuffer.java, GameWriteEvent and sixteen outgoing packet classes with original contexts. Numeric decoders for selected 69 opcodes only; original RT4 Buffer/Packet primitives and verbatim selected Protocol field-read prefixes, client-script argument loops, original JagString.charAt and inventory loops. Layer mapping, scene mutation and UI effects are excluded. Explicit world/entity/item/NULL_ITEM/interface-counter/artificial-player-false/ISAAC-zero/scene-coordinate adapters; skill level/prayer/lifepoints resolved to the controlled same integer, XP and run-energy double values supplied explicitly; no chat/social decoding, action handling, UI reducer, geometry, collision or live world-entry claim.",
